<title>UK: BZW leads 68 mln stg issue for Housing Association.</title>
<headline>BZW leads 68 mln stg issue for Housing Association.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THE HOUSING ASSOCIATION FUNDING PLC</p>
<p> AMT    68.25 MLN STG COUPON     8.25	MATURITY    07.JUN.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.6293   PAY DATE  S-11.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  62.5 BP   REOFFER    99.6293   SPREAD	+56 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.75 PCT GILT DUE 2017</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		SECURED LOAN-BACKED ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
